// # Vector Database Approximate Nearest Neighbor (ANN) Facade
//
// Logline: Unified standard library facade for DiskANN, ScaNN, Vamana Graphs, HNSW, IVF, and Vector Indexes.
//
// Setup: Master entry point importing and re-exporting all 50 vector search, quantization, and ANN index subsystems.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import all 49 submodules covering DiskANN, ScaNN, HNSW, IVF, metrics, filters, and storage.
//   2. Re-export public constructors and convenient facade helpers for vector search and indexing.
//   3. Maintain unified standard library interface for high-performance vector database systems.

